{"version":1,"content":"<p>短短五年，Anthropic 從一家無名初創企業成長為估值超萬億美元的科技巨頭。 這家開發 Claude 人工智能平台的公司，由 7 名 2021 年從競品 OpenAI 離職的員工創立。再過數小時，他們都將成為身價數百億美元的富豪 —— 至少是賬面財富。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586986.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:24:33.551742+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T17:00:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:37.497841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:37.497841+00:00","content_hash":"ddc75c85bcddd972c76ca7da7743b100d8c8e9059ea1c46ac40f9c97f577b583","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}